{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54528","headline":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占云第三（京本作「占云第二十四○二十六首」） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军似鸟，盘绕在其（京本作「军」）中。\n此时（京本作「是」）上方天（京本作「苍加」）助顺，不宜复见黑云峰，连赤亦爲凶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54528.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54528","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}